typemoji (2.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows-Style Common Grouper and grid deduplication (388 base emojis).
  * Interactive live colour & skin tone selector bar with 6 swatches.
  * Direct corner triangle click and floating variation flyout.
  * Configurable global hotkeys with live key recorder in Preferences.
  * Recent and frequent history JSON export and import.
  * Curated Kaomoji library expansion to 89 expressions across 10 categories.
  * Customizable grid density (Compact, Standard, Large).

 -- TypEmoji Contributors <contact@typemoji.org>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0530

